Qwen3.8-27B NVFP4 16GB Deployment Project

This repository contains independent community documentation, scripts, benchmark observations, and deployment notes for running a Qwen3.8-27B GGUF derivative with llama.cpp on a 16 GB NVIDIA GPU.

Upstream components and projects referenced by this repository include:

- Qwen / Alibaba Cloud — Qwen3.8-27B base model and associated multimodal weights/configuration.
- ggml-org / llama.cpp — GGUF tooling, llama-server, CUDA backend, and multimodal conversion utilities.
- NVIDIA — CUDA platform and RTX 5060 Ti hardware used for local validation.
- Hugging Face — upstream model hosting and model-repository infrastructure.

This repository is not an official release from any of the organizations above and does not imply endorsement or affiliation.

